network-manager-outline (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stay connected when the network changes
  * Support dynamic ssconf:// access keys
  * Add CI: PR checks, package builds and PPA releases
  * Render the icons as PNG at 16, 32, 64 and 128 px
  * Add license files
  * Add Debian packaging
  * Rename the icons to nm-outline
  * Add project icon and rewrite the README
  * Implement the Plasma VPN plugin for Outline
  * Make `sudo make install` work
  * Report a wrong access key as a login failure
  * Update plan with status and next steps
  * Fix issues found by the first end-to-end test
  * Document running the TUN test as root
  * Implement Outline tunnel on outline-sdk
  * Verify NM VPN D-Bus layer against libnm and add docs
  * Initial commit

